---

<section id="testimoni" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/60 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        ⭐️ Bukti &amp; Rekam Jejak Lapangan
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50 tracking-tight mb-4">
        Cerita Keberhasilan <span class="text-gradient">Implementasi Sistem</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Sistem otomasi nyata yang telah terbukti menghemat ratusan jam kerja dan mengeliminasi kesalahan manusia di lapangan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 mb-4 text-sm">
            ★★★★★
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
            "Sistem kasir smartphone dan rekap otomatis dari Kang Apri sangat membantu kedai kami. Laba kotor harian, HPP bumbu, dan sisa stok bahan baku langsung terhitung rapi tanpa perlu sewa server bulanan yang mahal."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800/60">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            🥩
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Tim Operasional &amp; Kasir</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Megumi Hotplate Cimahi</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 mb-4 text-sm">
            ★★★★★
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
            "Aplikasi KOMANDO benar-benar merevolusi jalannya lomba. Rekapitulasi nilai juri yang biasanya memakan waktu hingga 2 jam selesai dalam hitungan detik tanpa jeda input. Pengumuman juara Kejurcab jadi tepat waktu!"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800/60">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            🏆
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Panitia Tabulasi &amp; Juri</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Paskibra MAN Kota Cimahi &amp; SMPN 3</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 mb-4 text-sm">
            ★★★★★
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
            "Alur kerja order Scalev dan pengiriman draft dokumen otomatis via Google Workspace sangat terstruktur. Sangat recommended untuk solopreneur yang ingin sistem serba otomatis dan rapi."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800/60">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            📄
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Klien Layanan Dokumen</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Teras Tulis &amp; E-Commerce</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
